{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[{"author":"Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe","id":"boyd-convex-optimization","locator":"Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）","source_path":"","title":"Convex Optimization","url":"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/","year":"2004"}],"english_title":"Convex Combination","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<h1>凸组合（Convex Combination）</h1>\n<p>凸组合（convex combination）是非负系数、系数之和为一的组合：<span class=\"math inline\">y=\\sum_i\\theta_i x_i</span>，<span class=\"math inline\">\\theta_i\\ge0</span>，<span class=\"math inline\">\\sum_i\\theta_i=1</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>线段（line segment）</strong>：对于 <span class=\"math inline\">x_1, x_2 \\in E, x_1 \\neq x_2</span>，形如 <span class=\"math inline\">y=\\theta x_1 + (1-\\theta)x_2， 0 \\leq \\theta \\leq 1</span> 的点构成的集合称为 <span class=\"math inline\">x_1, x_2</span> 之间的线段。</p>\n<p>因此两点的凸组合走遍整个线段；两点的<a href=\"#/learn/opt.affine-combination?anchor=definition\">仿射组合</a>则走遍整条直线。</p>\n<p>参考：<a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/\">教材相应章节 / Reference</a>。</p>\n<section class=\"bibliography\"><h2>参考资料</h2><ol>\n<li id=\"reference-boyd-convex-optimization\"><a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/\">Convex Optimization</a> — Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe · 2004 · Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）</li>\n</ol></section>\n","id":"opt.convex-combination.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"opt.convex-combination","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"凸组合"}],"anchors":["definition"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[{"author":"Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe","id":"boyd-convex-optimization","locator":"Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）","source_path":"","title":"Convex Optimization","url":"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/","year":"2004"}],"english_title":"Convex Combination","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<h1>凸组合（Convex Combi